 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2018-11-15",
   "text": "Estate Tax Rate Reduction Act \n This bill amends the Internal Revenue Code to reduce the rate for the tax on estates, gifts, and generation-skipping transfers to 20%. (Under current law, the highest rate is 40%.) \n The bill also exempts the budgetary effects of the tax reduction from the Pay-As-You-Go (PAYGO) rules established by the Statutory Pay-As-You-Go Act of 2010 and the FY2018 congressional budget resolution."
  }
 ],
